## Interface: 16001
## Title: Spatial Plates
## Notes: Non-combat spatial overlay for player nameplates (distance, subzone, indoors/outdoors, underwater). Informational only — never reads health, power, auras, cooldowns, damage, healing, or threat. Degrades gracefully when a value is secret/unreadable.
## Author: Spatial Plates
## Version: 1.3.1
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Misc_Spyglass_03
## SavedVariables: SpatialPlatesDB
## X-Category: Nameplates
## X-Website: https://github.com/SeanShaffer88/Spatial-Plates
## X-License: MIT

# Load order matters: Config (defaults + DB + codec + slash + options) ->
# Presets (partial profile tables) -> Appearance (apply profile to frames) ->
# Core (events, ticker, overlay lifecycle). All top-level code only defines
# tables/functions; initialization happens on ADDON_LOADED, so order is safe.
Config.lua
Presets.lua
Appearance.lua
Range.lua
Core.lua
Minimap.lua
